      "name": "A Pattern Is Not a Verdict",
      "description": "The Seedwardens hope Siltmere's seedling bands can reveal how water moved during the disputed harvest. The Terrace Compact is divided over whether to trust those records, while the Weir Council fears that a pattern may be used to reopen old accusations without proving who took the grain.",
      "faction_ids": [
        "fac_seedwardens",
        "fac_weir_council",
        "fac_terrace_compact"
      ]
    }
  ]
}

